    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Miniatures is a cozy puzzle game where you start a journey in the world of a bookworm girl. In this journey, you're tasked with solving puzzles of miniature-style illustrations to create cities by fitting blocks, making paths by aligning roads &amp; rivers and reanimating landmarks by matching pieces.<br><br><strong>Some of the features of the game!</strong><br><br>- Creating the cities as you like while solving puzzles<br><br>- Matching pieces of the forgotten tombs, temples and landmarks<br><br>- Relaxing atmosphere and cozy gameplay<br><br>- &quot;Miniature&quot; art-style inspired by illuminated manuscripts<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832810/extras/2bf98c8517c9051a1e92b7ef782f313d.poster.avif?t=1728808653\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832810/extras/2bf98c8517c9051a1e92b7ef782f313d.webm?t=1728808653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832810/extras/2bf98c8517c9051a1e92b7ef782f313d.mp4?t=1728808653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Within this 2D journey, players are invited for a travel like sight-seeings which is the essence of the book the game inspired by. Miniatures game is inspired by the works of an Ottoman statesman &quot;Matrak\u00e7\u0131 Nasuh&quot;. In his book called &quot;Bey\u00e2n-\u0131 Men\u00e2zil-i Sefer-i Ir\u00e2keyn&quot;, he includes lovely miniature style paintings of the places that the imperial army passed by, stopped at or visited for various reasons.",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>Miniatures is a cozy puzzle game where you start a journey in the world of a bookworm girl. In this journey, you're tasked with solving puzzles of miniature-style illustrations to create cities by fitting blocks, making paths by aligning roads &amp; rivers and reanimating landmarks by matching pieces.<br><br><strong>Some of the features of the game!</strong><br><br>- Creating the cities as you like while solving puzzles<br><br>- Matching pieces of the forgotten tombs, temples and landmarks<br><br>- Relaxing atmosphere and cozy gameplay<br><br>- &quot;Miniature&quot; art-style inspired by illuminated manuscripts<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832810/extras/2bf98c8517c9051a1e92b7ef782f313d.poster.avif?t=1728808653\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832810/extras/2bf98c8517c9051a1e92b7ef782f313d.webm?t=1728808653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832810/extras/2bf98c8517c9051a1e92b7ef782f313d.mp4?t=1728808653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Within this 2D journey, players are invited for a travel like sight-seeings which is the essence of the book the game inspired by. Miniatures game is inspired by the works of an Ottoman statesman &quot;Matrak\u00e7\u0131 Nasuh&quot;. In his book called &quot;Bey\u00e2n-\u0131 Men\u00e2zil-i Sefer-i Ir\u00e2keyn&quot;, he includes lovely miniature style paintings of the places that the imperial army passed by, stopped at or visited for various reasons.",
